'''Alolan Marowak''' (Japanese: '''アローラガラガラ''' ''Alolan Garagara'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

