==Trivia==
This card's standard illustration depicts the three dancing Alolan Marowak from [[Kiawe]]'s [[trial]] at [[Wela Volcano Park]] in [[Pokémon Sun and Moon|Pokémon Sun, Moon]], [[Pokémon Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon|Ultra Sun, and Ultra Moon]].

===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Marowak}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Alolan Marowak|64}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*'''Burning Bonemarang''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Alolan Marowak|12}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

